I tried to convey a DIF analysis for an 8-item scale
containing the dichotomous items

 "Q1"  "Q7"  "Q10"
"Q11" "Q12" "Q30" "Q32" "Q33"

 For that purpose I estimated a multipleGroup-model

mymodel = multipleGroup(mydata, 1, group=mygroup,
itemtype="2PL", SE=TRUE,

invariance=c("Q10","Q30","free_mean","free_var"))
# Q10 and Q30 used as anchors

followed by the DIF, excluding the anchor items:

DIF(mymodel,which.par=c("a1","d"),items2test=c("Q1","Q7","Q11","Q12","Q32","Q33"))

now I obtain the following output:

|++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++| 100% elapsed=11s

converged     AIC
SABIC      HQ
BIC     X2 df     p

Q1       TRUE
2.106  10.183   6.990  16.539  1.894  2 0.388

Q7       TRUE -30.737
-22.660 -25.853 -16.304 34.737 2     0

Q10      TRUE
0.000   0.000   0.000
0.000      0  0 NaN   ???

