Subject: Implementing a Hybrid Linear and Computerized Adaptive Testing System for Balanced Content Delivery
Message-ID: <WGdZYNygK88.1Xm0BQhhAAAJ@mirt-package.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/mirt-package/c/WGdZYNygK88/m/1Xm0BQhhAAAJ>
